{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9000_situation", "source_sha256": "04ae5e352c64dbd13e543ad293c42566f0b99135003257e00f072f932e0bb208", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影中", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　拍摄中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9000_place", "source_sha256": "180bd8604df67b59be5113c13a960d8425c997dd86021e844f7f3b3e3e77f7a3", "ja": "新宿", "zh": "新宿", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9001_p", "source_sha256": "d13f7416e3b0f46a2e7e601b67751b24770536722780c8324d51260c5ac0d3a0", "ja": "（今はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影中\nなのだが、どうも未来の様子がおかしいような……）", "zh": "（现在正在给偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》拍写真，不过未来的样子好像有点不对劲……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9002_p", "source_sha256": "97a11527b1bfd8b7ab12efe8c9973bb78796cda8b9627d99d219a49bb6673245", "ja": "未来。さっきから浮かない顔だけど、\nなにか引っかかってることでもあるのか？", "zh": "未来，你从刚才开始就一脸闷闷不乐的，是有什么在意的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9003_014mir", "source_sha256": "749a1311d58e5823757c48d64c12b6fb3334c6b132b8dde160c86ec095bc347e", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\n引っかかってるっていうか、よくわからなくて……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n与其说是困扰，不如说是我搞不太明白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9004_p", "source_sha256": "b98d8c805680066915890c632f907251754f8256a84f367148165ace99490bce", "ja": "よくわからない……？", "zh": "不太明白……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9005_014mir", "source_sha256": "211cdaaf52f0cdce9015cc4d0867c9c909e350e38d9576c40ee7513e12a326d5", "ja": "はい。撮影の資料に『いつもひとりでいる\n猫みたいな子』って、書いてあったんですけど……。", "zh": "是的。拍摄资料上写着“总是独自一人的猫咪般的孩子”，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9006_014mir", "source_sha256": "9139fcea64c4cf1412cf0309110342a24319ab08fc009598ab81e5e8ecdb0bdd", "ja": "この子は、なんでひとりでいるんだろう？って\n考えちゃって……。絶対、友達といた方が楽しいのに！", "zh": "我就忍不住想，这孩子为什么总是一个人呢……明明和朋友们在一起肯定会更开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9007", "source_sha256": "4a77bef618f4911801756e6c6bf650aeeef4949000c1d57517fb56e2d4cda3e0", "ja": "想像してみよう", "zh": "想象一下吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9008", "source_sha256": "e3f42f84f6cd21bfddf925731a618471d98541eae49571fed2968dbe8ed6a6db", "ja": "もっと話を聞く", "zh": "听更多介绍", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9200_p", "source_sha256": "36a1b117c0d6ad47d687d3f334bd797200e93b9c294fd384a441a43df2ffae8d", "ja": "じゃあ、想像を少し広げてみよう！　その子も友達が\n欲しいと思ってるけど、怖くて言い出せない、とか？", "zh": "那就稍微放开想象吧！会不会其实那个孩子也想要朋友，\n只是太害怕了开不了口呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9201_014mir", "source_sha256": "482784af26e7da9fcbc2a6363d8ce49a7142debf23b339298b46ebd92fa5395f", "ja": "あ……。私、ひとりでいるのが好きな子なのかなって\n思ってたんですけど……そうじゃないのかも！", "zh": "啊……我原本以为，她是喜欢独处的孩子……但或许并不是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9202_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b47a79a52dc5e349cbb35c620930fb582831c2b99b11f54f755223950553de5", "ja": "この子のこと、わかった気がします♪\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我好像明白这孩子了♪谢谢你，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9300_p", "source_sha256": "36a1b117c0d6ad47d687d3f334bd797200e93b9c294fd384a441a43df2ffae8d", "ja": "じゃあ、想像を少し広げてみよう！　その子も友達が\n欲しいと思ってるけど、怖くて言い出せない、とか？", "zh": "那就稍微放开想象吧！会不会其实那个孩子也想要朋友，\n只是太害怕了开不了口呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9301_014mir", "source_sha256": "d449fe92b2f3cae01cc72dbbfdf0e62136801f4fee49b3ff60d4e0e3c339c255", "ja": "本当は友達が欲しいのに、言い出せない……？\nうーん、私だったら、すぐに話しかけちゃうけど……。", "zh": "明明想交朋友，却说不出口……？\n嗯——如果是我的话，肯定会马上去搭话……陪、】【", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9302_014mir", "source_sha256": "8043a210bb7e51c303f5c40abf74c0f3a7b8be7b3949ef105e28d91f5da05bec", "ja": "でも、私とは違いますもんね。もっと想像しなくちゃ！\nもっと、この子になったつもりで……むむむ～……。", "zh": "可是，和我不一样嘛。得再多想象一下才行！\n再多设身处地地想想这个孩子……嗯嗯嗯～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9500_p", "source_sha256": "c6169ae12b41fb901b698949224bdcb98370d5033daf46cb6b03ca6ac5b345b5", "ja": "確かに、未来の言う通りだ。じゃあ未来は、\nどうしてこの子はひとりでいるんだと思う？", "zh": "确实，正如未来所说。那未来觉得，\n这个孩子为什么是一个人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9501_014mir", "source_sha256": "da34540259b0c73423d580f97f0bdde648aab730db2d9f2c37686a620790bbc4", "ja": "もしかしたらですけど……周りの人を信じられないの\nかなって。だから、ひとりでいるのかもって……。", "zh": "会不会……是因为没法相信身边的人呢。\n所以才一个人呆着的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9502_p", "source_sha256": "68b5a11db52a58cc8b3c7c36264f56e593c73c4392e3e8b03a8c7455f4f41c84", "ja": "未来は、そう思ったんだな……。\nうん。答えは未来の中にちゃんとあるみたいだな！", "zh": "未来，你是这么想的啊……。\n嗯。看来答案确实就在未来心中啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9503_014mir", "source_sha256": "d92cb5c1012f30c50265cae4fc6cfa6e98dc685e0fab16fb2da11af956f88cb7", "ja": "答え……あっ！　これでよかったんですね、えへへ。\nよーし！　この後の撮影も、もっと頑張りまーす♪", "zh": "答案……啊！原来这样就对了呢，嘿嘿。\n好——！接下来的拍摄我也会更加努力的——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9600_p", "source_sha256": "c6169ae12b41fb901b698949224bdcb98370d5033daf46cb6b03ca6ac5b345b5", "ja": "確かに、未来の言う通りだ。じゃあ未来は、\nどうしてこの子はひとりでいるんだと思う？", "zh": "确实，正如未来所说。那未来觉得，\n这个孩子为什么是一个人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9601_014mir", "source_sha256": "c193f90ecad6a57cdca6ab48a89a11d9cb431db80e9983b43091fb7bb0d4da45", "ja": "えっ！？　えっと……どうしてだろう？\nうーんと……ちょっと待ってくださいね！", "zh": "诶！？呃……为什么呢？\n嗯……请稍等一下哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_9602_014mir", "source_sha256": "63f29d31301cf208b9eaf05061131fbd2d514fb0802b1d1bb99dc19134c824f4", "ja": "『猫みたいな子』っていうくらいだから、人間が嫌い\nなのかな？　でも人間が好きな猫もいるし……うーん？", "zh": "既然被称为“像猫一样的孩子”，难道是不喜欢人类吗？不过也有喜欢人类的猫……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
